{"unit_id":"ZhaoAndy821__dsh-motion-background#card-zh","repo":"ZhaoAndy821/dsh-motion-background","commit":"73f77106486ddf69b7f6bc5881e9582c36f9dc53","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-motion-background 是面向 DSH WebUI 的动态背景插件。它由宿主扫描 mods 目录并通过接口把效果交给浏览器，在设置页加入背景控制面板。效果包括 WebGL2 实时着色器动画和原生视频、图片背景；用户可以切换效果、调整可用参数、设置视频循环或往返播放，并恢复默认配置。适合希望为 DSH 对话界面更换动态底色的 Web 用户。着色器效果需要浏览器支持 WebGL2，媒体效果使用原生媒体播放，不需要额外账号或 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:96-160","lib/client.js:949-1115","lib/client.js:1165-1383"]}
{"unit_id":"ZhaoAndy821__dsh-motion-background#card-en","repo":"ZhaoAndy821/dsh-motion-background","commit":"73f77106486ddf69b7f6bc5881e9582c36f9dc53","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-motion-background adds animated backgrounds to the DSH WebUI. It serves shader, video, and image effects from mods and adds controls to settings. Users can switch effects, adjust shader parameters, and choose loop or ping-pong video playback. Shader effects require WebGL2; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:96-160","lib/client.js:949-1115","lib/client.js:1165-1383"]}
