{"unit_id":"ZhaoAndy821__dsh-motion-background#feature-1","repo":"ZhaoAndy821/dsh-motion-background","commit":"73f77106486ddf69b7f6bc5881e9582c36f9dc53","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-motion-background 的功能「着色器背景」：将 mod 提供的 GLSL 片段着色器编译为 WebGL2 全屏背景动画。启用插件后自动加载默认效果，用户可在设置面板切换可用效果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:108-176","lib/client.js:949-1036"]}
